# Blademaster's native checks by parity: #124 Wind Walk Backstab and Mirror Image swap.
# Blademaster a against Blademaster b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero blademaster
40 b stick -1 0
48 b stick 0 0
# Wind Walk toward b, Backstab on its 16th frame.
60 a stick 1 0
60 a tap X 2
61 a stick 0 0
75 a tap A 2
# Mirror Image, then the swap with its slash.
200 a stick 0 -1
200 a tap X 2
201 a stick 0 0
260 a stick 0 -1
260 a tap X 2
261 a stick 0 0
# Counterplay: b's held shield blocks the swap slash.
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
600 a stick 0 -1
600 a tap X 2
601 a stick 0 0
620 b shield 1
650 a stick 0 -1
650 a tap X 2
651 a stick 0 0
700 b shield 0
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script):
#! expect a 60 special 14 form 0
#! expect a 75 special-form 6 action 14
#! expect b 80 damage 11.460
#! expect a 200 special 16 form 0
#! expect a 223 special 0 form 0 action-frame 0 x -202.456
#! expect a 260 special 16 form 3
#! expect b 267 damage 21.010
#! expect a 650 special 16 form 3
#! absent b 620-700 damage
#! scene a MirrorImageCaster
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
